{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: HJ, holding 9c Ac.\nStacks (bb): HJ 111.15(hero), BB 112.94.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ raise to 2.0, CO fold, BTN fold, SB fold, BB raise to 6.5, HJ call\nFlop [3s 9h 9s]: BB bet to 4.46\nPot 17.96bb, to-call 4.46bb. Legal: fold, call 4.46, bet/raise 8.92..111.15.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the flop.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=26.9)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=26.9)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=26.9)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 26.9}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.558, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
