{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: UTG, holding Ks 9s.\nStacks (bb): UTG 67.28(hero), SB 42.43.\nPreflop: UTG raise to 2.0, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN fold, SB call, BB fold\nFlop [6s 9d Kd]: SB check, UTG bet to 2.5, SB call\nTurn [6s 9d Kd 5c]: SB check, UTG bet to 6.6, SB call\nRiver [6s 9d Kd 5c 9c]: SB bet to 15.31, UTG raise to 58.37, SB raise to 170.32\nPot 251.89bb, to-call 111.95bb. Legal: fold, call 111.95.\nHero to act on the river.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=475.8)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=475.8)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=475.8)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 475.8}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.483, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
