{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: HJ, holding 9s As.\nStacks (bb): HJ 677.02(hero), BTN 159.92.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ raise to 2.0, CO fold, BTN raise to 7.5, SB call, BB call, HJ call\nFlop [Ks Js Ts]: SB check, BB check, HJ check, BTN check\nTurn [Ks Js Ts 8d]: SB check, BB check, HJ check, BTN bet to 19.8, SB fold, BB fold\nPot 49.8bb, to-call 19.8bb. Legal: fold, call 19.8, bet/raise 39.6..677.02.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=89.4)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=89.4)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=89.4)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 89.4}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.472, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
