{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: SB, holding Jc Qc.\nStacks (bb): SB 32.25(hero), BB 4842.45.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB call, BB raise to 10.0, BTN fold, SB call\nFlop [7h Kc 3c]: SB check, BB bet to 11.25, SB call\nTurn [7h Kc 3c Tc]: SB check, BB bet to 29.7\nPot 74.7bb, to-call 29.7bb. Legal: fold, call 29.7, bet/raise 32.25..32.25.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=134.1)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=134.1)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=134.1)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 134.1}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.439, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
