{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 3 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BB, holding Jd Ac.\nStacks (bb): BB 1107.22(hero), HJ 292.94, BTN 69.61.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ raise to 2.5, CO fold, BTN call, SB fold, BB call\nFlop [3c 9c 4d]: BB check, HJ check, BTN check\nTurn [3c 9c 4d 7d]: BB check, HJ bet to 5.28, BTN call, BB call\nRiver [3c 9c 4d 7d Jh]: BB check, HJ bet to 15.73, BTN call\nPot 55.3bb, to-call 15.73bb. Legal: fold, call 15.73, bet/raise 31.46..1107.22.\nHero to act on the river.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=86.8)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=86.8)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=86.8)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 86.8}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.43, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
