{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 3 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: SB, holding Qc Kc.\nStacks (bb): SB 28.42(hero), UTG 0.0, BTN 212.67.\nPreflop: UTG raise to 2.5, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 9.0, SB call, BB fold, UTG raise to 37.0, BTN call, SB call\nFlop [Qh 8s 4s]: SB bet to 73.92, UTG raise to 148.56, BTN call\nPot 483.04bb, to-call 74.64bb. Legal: fold, call 74.64.\nHero to act on the flop.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=632.3)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=632.3)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=632.3)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 632.3}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.421, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
