{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BB, holding Ks 8c.\nStacks (bb): BB 230.56(hero), BTN 179.68.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB fold, BB call\nFlop [7h Kh Kd]: BB check, BTN bet to 1.82\nPot 7.32bb, to-call 1.82bb. Legal: fold, call 1.82, bet/raise 3.64..230.56.\nHero to act on the flop.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=11.0)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=11.0)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=11.0)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 11.0}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.411, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
