{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BTN, holding 3h 3c.\nStacks (bb): BTN 356.22(hero), BB 450.56.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB fold, BB call\nFlop [Kd Ac 3s]: BB check, BTN bet to 1.82, BB call\nTurn [Kd Ac 3s 8d]: BB bet to 6.03\nPot 15.17bb, to-call 6.03bb. Legal: fold, call 6.03, bet/raise 12.06..356.22.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=27.2)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=27.2)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=27.2)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 27.2}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.409, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
