{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BTN, holding As 8d.\nStacks (bb): BTN 91.27(hero), BB 7.02.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO raise to 2.5, BTN call, SB call, BB call\nFlop [5s 7h 4s]: SB check, BB check, CO bet to 5.0, BTN call, SB call, BB call\nTurn [5s 7h 4s 6c]: SB check, BB check, CO check, BTN bet to 19.8, SB fold, BB raise to 75.48, CO fold\nPot 125.28bb, to-call 55.68bb. Legal: fold, call 55.68, bet/raise 111.07..111.07.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=236.6)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=236.6)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=236.6)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 236.6}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.397, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
