{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 3 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BB, holding Th Ad.\nStacks (bb): BB 179.12(hero), UTG 7407.16, HJ 93.21.\nPreflop: UTG raise to 2.0, HJ call, CO fold, BTN fold, SB fold, BB call\nFlop [Jd Js Qh]: BB check, UTG check, HJ check\nTurn [Jd Js Qh Kc]: BB check, UTG bet to 4.29, HJ call\nPot 15.08bb, to-call 4.29bb. Legal: fold, call 4.29, bet/raise 8.58..179.12.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=23.7)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=23.7)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=23.7)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 23.7}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.37, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
