{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: BTN, holding Ah Kc.\nStacks (bb): BTN 190.98(hero), SB 137.38.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB raise to 8.5, BB fold, BTN raise to 26.5, SB call\nFlop [4d 7d 2s]: SB check, BTN check\nTurn [4d 7d 2s Ac]: SB bet to 35.64\nPot 89.64bb, to-call 35.64bb. Legal: fold, call 35.64, bet/raise 71.28..190.98.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=160.9)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=160.9)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=160.9)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 160.9}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.356, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
