{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: UTG, holding Kh Th.\nStacks (bb): UTG 46.35(hero), SB 135.66.\nPreflop: UTG raise to 2.0, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN fold, SB call, BB fold\nFlop [9s 7c Kd]: SB check, UTG bet to 1.65, SB raise to 8.29, UTG raise to 25.55, SB raise to 70.43, UTG call\nTurn [9s 7c Kd Ts]: SB bet to 96.27\nPot 242.13bb, to-call 96.27bb. Legal: fold, call 96.27.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.30, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# read: MIX by equity vs the price, and EXPLOIT the table — a folder turns our air into a bluff-raise\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nreq = api.required_equity(spot.to_call, spot.pot)\nif eq >= req + 0.2:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.75, 'call': 0.25}, size=434.7)\nelif eq >= req:\n    decide_mix({'call': 0.8, 'raise': 0.2}, size=434.7)\nelif spot.villain_fold >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'raise': 0.55, 'fold': 0.45}, size=434.7)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'fold': 0.8, 'call': 0.2})", "action": {"action": "raise", "size_bb": 434.7}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.329, "villain_fold": 0.3, "phase": "a"}}
