{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 3 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: SB, holding 8s Ad.\nStacks (bb): SB 94.25(hero), BB 6436.81, BTN 176.84.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB call, BB call\nFlop [Js Td 5s]: SB check, BB check, BTN bet to 3.75, SB call, BB call\nTurn [Js Td 5s Ts]: (checks through / to act)\nPot 18.75bb, to-call 0.0bb. Legal: check, bet/raise 1.0..94.25.\nHero to act on the turn.", "completion": "# postflop: PREFER the trained GTO bet-frequency advisor; fall back to equity\nf = api.solver_freq(spot.hero_hole, spot.board, 'oop', 'turn')\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nif f is not None and f >= 0.5:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.8, 'check': 0.2}, size=11.2)\nelif f is not None:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.8, 'bet': 0.2}, size=11.2)\nelif eq >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.75, 'check': 0.25}, size=11.2)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.85, 'bet': 0.15})", "action": {"action": "check", "size_bb": null}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.163, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
