{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: CO, holding 6c Ah.\nStacks (bb): CO 55.75(hero), BTN 331.57.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO raise to 2.5, BTN raise to 9.0, SB fold, BB fold, CO call\nFlop [Jc 3c 9c]: CO check, BTN bet to 9.75, CO call\nTurn [Jc 3c 9c 7c]: CO bet to 19.5, BTN call\nRiver [Jc 3c 9c 7c Qs]: (checks through / to act)\nPot 78.0bb, to-call 0.0bb. Legal: check, bet/raise 1.0..55.75.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the river.", "completion": "# postflop: PREFER the trained GTO bet-frequency advisor; fall back to equity\nf = api.solver_freq(spot.hero_hole, spot.board, 'ip', 'river')\nvr = api.range_top(0.1)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nif f is not None and f >= 0.5:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.8, 'check': 0.2}, size=46.8)\nelif f is not None:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.8, 'bet': 0.2}, size=46.8)\nelif eq >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.75, 'check': 0.25}, size=46.8)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.85, 'bet': 0.15})", "action": {"action": "check", "size_bb": null}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.11, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
