{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: CO, holding Qh Kd.\nStacks (bb): CO 86.24(hero), HJ 87.74.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ raise to 2.5, CO call, BTN fold, SB fold, BB fold\nFlop [Qs 4c 4h]: HJ bet to 2.14, CO raise to 10.76, HJ call\nTurn [Qs 4c 4h 4d]: HJ check, CO check\nRiver [Qs 4c 4h 4d 5d]: HJ check\nPot 28.02bb, to-call 0.0bb. Legal: check, bet/raise 1.0..86.24.\nHero to act on the river.", "completion": "# postflop: PREFER the trained GTO bet-frequency advisor; fall back to equity\nf = api.solver_freq(spot.hero_hole, spot.board, 'ip', 'river')\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nif f is not None and f >= 0.5:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.8, 'check': 0.2}, size=16.8)\nelif f is not None:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.8, 'bet': 0.2}, size=16.8)\nelif eq >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.75, 'check': 0.25}, size=16.8)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.85, 'bet': 0.15})", "action": {"action": "check", "size_bb": null}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.104, "villain_fold": 0.5, "phase": "a"}}
