{"source": "selfplay", "type": "decision", "spot": "6-max NLHE, 2 active. Big blind = 1bb.\nHero: SB, holding 5d Ac.\nStacks (bb): SB 94.52(hero), BTN 3092.65.\nPreflop: UTG fold, HJ fold, CO fold, BTN raise to 2.5, SB call, BB fold\nFlop [5c 3s Qd]: SB check, BTN bet to 1.98, SB call\nTurn [5c 3s Qd 9h]: SB check, BTN check\nRiver [5c 3s Qd 9h 5h]: (checks through / to act)\nPot 9.96bb, to-call 0.0bb. Legal: check, bet/raise 1.0..94.52.\nVillain read: fold-to-bet 0.70, aggression 0.70.\nHero to act on the river.", "completion": "# postflop: PREFER the trained GTO bet-frequency advisor; fall back to equity\nf = api.solver_freq(spot.hero_hole, spot.board, 'oop', 'river')\nvr = api.range_top(0.18)\neq = api.equity(spot.hero_hole, vr, spot.board)\nif f is not None and f >= 0.5:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.8, 'check': 0.2}, size=6.0)\nelif f is not None:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.8, 'bet': 0.2}, size=6.0)\nelif eq >= 0.6:\n    decide_mix({'bet': 0.75, 'check': 0.25}, size=6.0)\nelse:\n    decide_mix({'check': 0.85, 'bet': 0.15})", "action": {"action": "check", "size_bb": null}, "meta": {"derived": true, "clarity": 0.1, "villain_fold": 0.7, "phase": "a"}}
